,{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p006","text":"光既得專諸，善客待之。九年而楚平王死。春，呉王僚欲因楚喪，使其二弟公子蓋餘、屬庸將兵圍楚之灊；使延陵季子於晉，以觀諸侯之變。楚發兵絶呉將蓋餘、屬庸路，呉兵不得還。於是公子光謂專諸曰：「此時不可失，不求何獲！且光眞王嗣，當立，季子雖來，不吾廢也。」專諸曰：「王僚可殺也。母老子弱，而兩弟將兵伐楚，楚絶其後。方今呉外困於楚，而内空無骨鯁之臣，是無如我何。」公子光頓首曰：「光之身，子之身也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"光","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004819","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"專諸","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004816","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"楚平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004825","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"呉王僚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004818","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0033","start":33,"end":37,"surface":"公子蓋餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004826","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"屬庸","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004827","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0048","start":48,"end":52,"surface":"延陵季子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004823","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名氏稱或尚待核定的嵌套親屬指代，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"蓋餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004826","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"屬庸","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004827","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0083","start":83,"end":86,"surface":"公子光","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004819","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0087","